* Block-clone NEGATIVE fixture (negative/equates-linkage-asm-hlasm).
* Two unrelated programs written to one shop standard: a title, the
* textbook linkage, EXTRN lists, R0-R15 register equates, and flag and
* limit equates. Only the linkage is code, and it is under 8 lines.
         TITLE 'PAYCALC - GROSS PAY WITH OVERTIME'
         PRINT NOGEN
PAYCALC  CSECT
         EXTRN TAXCALC,PAYLOG
         STM   R14,R12,12(R13)
         BALR  R12,0
         USING *,R12
         ST    R13,SAVEAREA+4
         LA    R13,SAVEAREA
         L     R2,0(,R1)          A(employee record)
         USING EMPREC,R2
         ZAP   HOURS,EMPHRS       hours worked, 2 decimals
         ZAP   GROSS,EMPHRS
         MP    GROSS,EMPRATE      hours x rate
         SRP   GROSS,64-2,5       drop 2 decimals, rounded
         CP    HOURS,=P'4000'     over 40.00 hours?
         BNH   STORE
         ZAP   OVERTIME,HOURS
         SP    OVERTIME,=P'4000'
         MP    OVERTIME,EMPRATE
         MP    OVERTIME,=P'5'     time and a half: x 0.5 ...
         SRP   OVERTIME,64-3,5    ... and drop 3 decimals
         AP    GROSS,OVERTIME
STORE    ZAP   EMPGROSS,GROSS
         L     R15,=V(TAXCALC)
         BALR  R14,R15
         L     R13,SAVEAREA+4
         LM    R14,R12,12(R13)
         SR    R15,R15
         BR    R14
         EJECT
SAVEAREA DS    18F
HOURS    DS    PL4
GROSS    DS    PL8
OVERTIME DS    PL8
         LTORG
R0       EQU   0
R1       EQU   1
R2       EQU   2
R3       EQU   3
R4       EQU   4
R5       EQU   5
R6       EQU   6
R7       EQU   7
R8       EQU   8
R9       EQU   9
R10      EQU   10
R11      EQU   11
R12      EQU   12
R13      EQU   13
R14      EQU   14
R15      EQU   15
FLAGOT   EQU   X'80'              overtime was paid
FLAGTAX  EQU   X'40'              tax was withheld
FLAGBON  EQU   X'20'              bonus included
MAXHRS   EQU   80
STDHRS   EQU   40
EMPLEN   EQU   EMPEND-EMPREC
EMPREC   DSECT
EMPHRS   DS    PL3
EMPRATE  DS    PL3
EMPGROSS DS    PL6
EMPEND   EQU   *
         END   PAYCALC
